{
    "title": "Always On AMOLED",
    "description": "<b>Always On Display (AOD)</b> and Always on Amoled app can transform your ordinary lock screen into an interactive, informative, and stylish lock screen. \r\n\r\n<h3><b>\ud83d\udcf1 Always On Display, Always On AMOLED! \ud83d\udcf1</b></h3>\r\nThe original and best are always on display for everyone. <b>Get an always on display for your phone or tablet.</b> Keep your screen lock on all the time.\r\n\r\nYour clock lock app screen is not just about functionality; it's about making your device truly yours. Change your Lock Screen Clock Style, pick from mesmerizing AMOLED Display Wallpapers, and much more! \ud83d\udcaf\ud83d\udc4c\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc49\ud83d\udc49\ud83d\udc49 Ready to revolutionize your device's display? Download our app now and enter the smart, stylish, and convenient Always On Display Clocks world.\r\n\r\n<h3><b>\ud83c\udf1f An Always On Display for every device! \ud83c\udf1f</b></h3>\r\nThis is made possible thanks to the AMOLED display app. Most of the screen stays black except for a few pixels.\r\n\r\n<b>\u2605\u2605\u2605 Notable FEATURES \u2605\u2605\u2605</b>\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcf1 Always On screen lock, always on display app, screen saver;\r\n\ud83c\udfa8 Customization - Tons of customization options, fonts, clock styles, and much more; \r\n\ud83d\udd12 Pocket mode - lock the device when you leave it in your pocket to save battery;\r\n\ud83d\udce9 Notifications - view notifications without touching your device;\r\n\u23f0  New: Now featuring Raise to Wake;\r\n\ud83d\uddbc\ufe0f New: Backgrounds and AMOLED Display Wallpapers;\r\n\ud83d\udca1 New: Edge glow for new notifications;\r\n\ud83d\udcd2 New: Quick note-taking! Quickly scribble or write from the always on display clock;\r\n\ud83c\udfb5 Music - control your music quickly and easily;\r\n\ud83c\udf19 Auto night mode - dim the screen automatically in a dark environment;\r\n\ud83d\udd0b Greenify integration - start Greenify automatically when locking the screen to save battery.\r\n\r\nCustomize your device with an array of <b>AMOLED Display Wallpapers</b> and <b>Lock Screen Clock Style Changes</b>. Tailor your screen lock to reflect your unique style, making every interaction with your device a delight.\r\n\r\n<h3><b>\ud83d\ude80 Transform with Always On AMOLED! \ud83d\ude80</b></h3>\r\n\u2705 Automatic rules - preserve battery using predefined rules;\r\n\u2705 Auto movement - avoid AMOLED burn-in;\r\n\u2705 View the weather at a glimpse;\r\n\u2705 Custom watch faces - Digital S7 style, Classic 24H, Analog S7 style, Analog Pebble style and more;\r\n\u2705 Always On Memo - write a reminder and make it show up on your screen all the time;\r\n\u2705 Double tap to wake + Swipe up to wake + Volume keys to wake + Back button to wake;\r\n\u2705 Force orientation - set your preferred screen orientation, screen saver;\r\n\u2705 Can be used as a night clock;\r\n\u2705 Tasker integration - Start/Stop the always on display clock (AOD), granting you infinite possibilities;\r\n\u2705 Force doze - AMOLED display app.\r\n\r\n\u2b07\ufe0f Download now and transform your device's <b>AMOLED Display app</b> into a hub of elegance, utility, and innovation. Say goodbye to the ordinary and embrace a lock screen that's always on. Your device deserves the best Always On Display App \u2013 get it today! \ud83c\udf1f\r\n\r\nUsers can have information about <b>time, date, notifications, and more without touching the phone.</b> Just by looking at it.\r\n\r\n<h3><b>\ud83d\udd52 Display Clock on Screen! \ud83d\udd52</b></h3>\r\nWhether it's day or night, our <b>Always On Display Amoled Clock</b> adapts to your environment. With the Always On AMOLED feature, you'll have a clear display.\r\n\r\nCustomizing your Display Clock on Screen is just a swipe away. Our user-friendly interface allows for quick and easy Lock Screen Clock Style Changes.\r\n\r\n<h3><b>\ud83c\udf0c\ud83c\udf0c\ud83c\udf0c Amoled Display, AOD Perfection! \ud83c\udf0c\ud83c\udf0c\ud83c\udf0c</b></h3>\r\nPermissions.\r\n<b>Camera permission.</b>\r\nThe app needs camera permission to toggle the flashlight\r\n<b>Phone permission.</b>\r\nThe app needs phone permission to recognize incoming calls, dismiss the always on screen, and show the incoming call screen.\r\n<b>Modify system settings permission.</b>\r\nThe app needs permission to modify system settings to change the brightness of the lock screen.\r\n\r\n** Note: For Xiaomi devices, you will need to access the Security App -> Permissions -> Permissions -> Always On AMOLED -> Display pop-up window permission and Show on Lock screen.",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b>Always On Display (AOD)</b> and Always on Amoled app can transform your ordinary lock screen into an interactive, informative, and stylish lock screen. <br><br><h3><b>\ud83d\udcf1 Always On Display, Always On AMOLED! \ud83d\udcf1</b></h3><br>The original and best are always on display for everyone. <b>Get an always on display for your phone or tablet.</b> Keep your screen lock on all the time.<br><br>Your clock lock app screen is not just about functionality; it&#39;s about making your device truly yours. Change your Lock Screen Clock Style, pick from mesmerizing AMOLED Display Wallpapers, and much more! \ud83d\udcaf\ud83d\udc4c<br><br>\ud83d\udc49\ud83d\udc49\ud83d\udc49 Ready to revolutionize your device&#39;s display? Download our app now and enter the smart, stylish, and convenient Always On Display Clocks world.<br><br><h3><b>\ud83c\udf1f An Always On Display for every device! \ud83c\udf1f</b></h3><br>This is made possible thanks to the AMOLED display app. Most of the screen stays black except for a few pixels.<br><br><b>\u2605\u2605\u2605 Notable FEATURES \u2605\u2605\u2605</b><br><br>\ud83d\udcf1 Always On screen lock, always on display app, screen saver;<br>\ud83c\udfa8 Customization - Tons of customization options, fonts, clock styles, and much more; <br>\ud83d\udd12 Pocket mode - lock the device when you leave it in your pocket to save battery;<br>\ud83d\udce9 Notifications - view notifications without touching your device;<br>\u23f0  New: Now featuring Raise to Wake;<br>\ud83d\uddbc\ufe0f New: Backgrounds and AMOLED Display Wallpapers;<br>\ud83d\udca1 New: Edge glow for new notifications;<br>\ud83d\udcd2 New: Quick note-taking! Quickly scribble or write from the always on display clock;<br>\ud83c\udfb5 Music - control your music quickly and easily;<br>\ud83c\udf19 Auto night mode - dim the screen automatically in a dark environment;<br>\ud83d\udd0b Greenify integration - start Greenify automatically when locking the screen to save battery.<br><br>Customize your device with an array of <b>AMOLED Display Wallpapers</b> and <b>Lock Screen Clock Style Changes</b>. Tailor your screen lock to reflect your unique style, making every interaction with your device a delight.<br><br><h3><b>\ud83d\ude80 Transform with Always On AMOLED! \ud83d\ude80</b></h3><br>\u2705 Automatic rules - preserve battery using predefined rules;<br>\u2705 Auto movement - avoid AMOLED burn-in;<br>\u2705 View the weather at a glimpse;<br>\u2705 Custom watch faces - Digital S7 style, Classic 24H, Analog S7 style, Analog Pebble style and more;<br>\u2705 Always On Memo - write a reminder and make it show up on your screen all the time;<br>\u2705 Double tap to wake + Swipe up to wake + Volume keys to wake + Back button to wake;<br>\u2705 Force orientation - set your preferred screen orientation, screen saver;<br>\u2705 Can be used as a night clock;<br>\u2705 Tasker integration - Start/Stop the always on display clock (AOD), granting you infinite possibilities;<br>\u2705 Force doze - AMOLED display app.<br><br>\u2b07\ufe0f Download now and transform your device&#39;s <b>AMOLED Display app</b> into a hub of elegance, utility, and innovation. Say goodbye to the ordinary and embrace a lock screen that&#39;s always on. Your device deserves the best Always On Display App \u2013 get it today! \ud83c\udf1f<br><br>Users can have information about <b>time, date, notifications, and more without touching the phone.</b> Just by looking at it.<br><br><h3><b>\ud83d\udd52 Display Clock on Screen! \ud83d\udd52</b></h3><br>Whether it&#39;s day or night, our <b>Always On Display Amoled Clock</b> adapts to your environment. With the Always On AMOLED feature, you&#39;ll have a clear display.<br><br>Customizing your Display Clock on Screen is just a swipe away. Our user-friendly interface allows for quick and easy Lock Screen Clock Style Changes.<br><br><h3><b>\ud83c\udf0c\ud83c\udf0c\ud83c\udf0c Amoled Display, AOD Perfection! \ud83c\udf0c\ud83c\udf0c\ud83c\udf0c</b></h3><br>Permissions.<br><b>Camera permission.</b><br>The app needs camera permission to toggle the flashlight<br><b>Phone permission.</b><br>The app needs phone permission to recognize incoming calls, dismiss the always on screen, and show the incoming call screen.<br><b>Modify system settings permission.</b><br>The app needs permission to modify system settings to change the brightness of the lock screen.<br><br>** Note: For Xiaomi devices, you will need to access the Security App -&gt; Permissions -&gt; Permissions -&gt; Always On AMOLED -&gt; Display pop-up window permission and Show on Lock screen.",
